06.208">tsu na</span><span begin="4:06.208" end="4:06.390">gi</span><span begin="4:06.390" end="4:07.011">to</span><span begin="4:07.011" end="4:07.371">me</span><span begin="4:07.371" end="4:07.735">ru</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="4:08.108" end="4:08.967">so ra</span><span begin="4:08.967" end="4:09.393">ni</span><span begin="4:09.393" end="4:10.107">me n</span><span begin="4:10.107" end="4:10.536">ji</span><span begin="4:10.536" end="4:10.906">te</span><span begin="4:11.355" end="4:12.124">bo ku</span><span begin="4:12.124" end="4:12.531">wo</span><span begin="4:12.531" end="4:13.176">yu ru</span><span begin="4:13.176" end="4:13.639">so</span><span begin="4:13.639" end="4:15.204">u</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>傘村トータ</songwriter><songwriter>Tota Kasamura</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:15.204"><div begin="28.729" end="4:15.204"><p begin="28.729" end="33.090" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.729" end="29.144" amll:empty-beat="1">「頑</span><span begin="29.144" end="29.322">張</span><span begin="29.322" end="29.736">れ」</span> <span begin="29.736" end="29.912">で</span><span begin="29.912" end="30.322">も</span> <span begin="30.696" end="31.098" amll:empty-beat="1">「大</span><span begin="31.098" end="31.525" amll:empty-beat="1">丈</span><span begin="31.525" end="31.692">夫」</span> <span begin="31.692" end="32.067">で</span><span begin="32.067" end="32.268">も</span><span begin="32.268" end="32.739">な</span><span begin="32.739" end="33.090">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">并不是 “要加油” 也不是 “没关系” / Neither a &quot;Keep going!&quot; nor any &quot;It&apos;s fine!&quot;</span></p><p begin="34.857" end="39.351" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.857" end="35.458" amll:empty-beat="1">「君</span><span begin="35.458" end="35.649">な</span><span begin="35.649" end="36.199">ら</span><span begin="37.020" end="37.212">で</span><span begin="37.212" end="37.411">き</span><span begin="37.411" end="37.811">る」</span> <span begin="37.811" end="38.013">で</span><span begin="38.013" end="38.591">も</span><span begin="38.591" end="38.980">な</span><span begin="38.980" end="39.351">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">更不是 “你一定可以做到” / Not even a single &quot;You can do it!&quot;</span></p><p begin="41.364" end="45.880" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.364" end="41.574">あ</span><span begin="41.574" end="41.703">の</span><span begin="41.703" end="41.961">日</span><span begin="41.961" end="42.549" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="42.549" end="42.960">が</span><span begin="43.334" end="43.538">言</span><span begin="43.538" end="43.727">わ</span><span begin="43.727" end="44.134">れ</span><span begin="44.134" end="44.318">た</span><span begin="44.318" end="44.720">か</span><span begin="44.720" end="44.901">っ</span><span begin="44.901" end="45.880">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我一直都在不懈地找寻着 / I&apos;ve been searching all this time</span></p><p begin="47.452" end="51.988" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.452" end="47.672">言</span><span begin="47.672" end="48.276" amll:empty-beat="1">葉</span><span begin="48.276" end="48.471">を</span><span begin="48.818" end="49.148">ず</span><span begin="49.148" end="49.664">っ</span><span begin="49.664" end="49.951">と</span><span begin="49.951" end="50.559" amll:empty-beat="1">探</span><span begin="50.559" end="51.010">し</span><span begin="51.010" end="51.232">て</span><span begin="51.232" end="51.988">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那天想听到的那句话 / For the words I wanted to be told on that day</span></p><p begin="53.797" end="58.559" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.797" end="54.215" amll:empty-beat="1">雨</span><span begin="54.215" end="54.415">に</span><span begin="54.415" end="54.604">も</span><span begin="54.604" end="54.968">負</span><span begin="54.968" end="55.165">け</span><span begin="55.165" end="55.548">て</span> <span begin="55.944" end="56.379" amll:empty-beat="1">風</span><span begin="56.379" end="56.761">に</span><span begin="56.761" end="56.936">も</span><span begin="56.936" end="57.342">負</span><span begin="57.342" end="57.542">け</span><span begin="57.542" end="58.559">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">抵不过暴雨 赢不过狂风 / I lost to the rain, I lost to the wind too</span></p><p begin="1:00.081" end="1:04.738" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.081" end="1:00.685" amll:empty-beat="1">丈</span><span begin="1:00.685" end="1:00.903">夫</span><span begin="1:00.903" end="1:01.378">な</span><span begin="1:02.268" end="1:03.077" amll:empty-beat="2">心</span><span begin="1:03.077" end="1:03.276">も</span><span begin="1:03.276" end="1:03.669">無</span><span begin="1:03.669" end="1:03.870">い</span><span begin="1:03.870" end="1:04.738">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">甚至没有坚韧的心 / I don&apos;t even have an enduring heart</span></p><p begin="1:06.538" end="1:10.988" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.538" end="1:06.817">ふ</span><span begin="1:06.817" end="1:07.017">と</span><span begin="1:07.017" end="1:07.253">見</span><span begin="1:07.253" end="1:07.634">上</span><span begin="1:07.634" end="1:07.844">げ</span><span begin="1:07.844" end="1:08.239">た</span><span begin="1:08.584" end="1:09.385" amll:empty-beat="1">曇</span><span begin="1:09.385" end="1:09.585">り</span><span begin="1:09.585" end="1:10.200" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="1:10.200" end="1:10.988">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">偶然抬头望见的阴沉天空 / But suddenly, The cloudy sky I looked up at</span></p><p begin="1:12.693" end="1:17.228" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.693" end="1:13.250" amll:empty-beat="1">優</span><span begin="1:13.250" end="1:13.507">し</span><span begin="1:13.507" end="1:13.848">く</span><span begin="1:14.517" end="1:15.329" amll:empty-beat="1">笑</span><span begin="1:15.329" end="1:15.694">っ</span><span begin="1:15.694" end="1:15.916">て</span><span begin="1:15.916" end="1:16.299">見</span><span begin="1:16.299" end="1:16.501">え</span><span begin="1:16.501" end="1:17.228">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">仿佛正温柔地朝我微笑 / Seemed as if it was giving me a gentle smile</span></p><p begin="1:17.872" end="1:23.988" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.872" end="1:18.043">生</span><span begin="1:18.043" end="1:18.282">き</span><span begin="1:18.282" end="1:18.479">る</span><span begin="1:18.479" end="1:18.880">意</span><span begin="1:18.880" end="1:19.062">味</span><span begin="1:19.062" end="1:19.649">な</span><span begin="1:19.649" end="1:20.031">ん</span><span begin="1:20.031" end="1:20.828">て</span> <span begin="1:21.176" end="1:21.562">理</span><span begin="1:21.562" end="1:22.224" amll:empty-beat="1">由</span><span begin="1:22.224" end="1:22.796">な</span><span begin="1:22.796" end="1:23.224">ん</span><span begin="1:23.224" end="1:23.988">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所谓活着的意义 还有理由之类的 / It&apos;s completely natural to not understand</span></p><p begin="1:24.420" end="1:31.450" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.420" end="1:24.799">わ</span><span begin="1:24.799" end="1:25.171">か</span><span begin="1:25.171" end="1:25.580">ら</span><span begin="1:25.580" end="1:25.927">な</span><span begin="1:25.927" end="1:26.149">く</span><span begin="1:26.149" end="1:26.746">て</span><span begin="1:26.746" end="1:27.104">当</span><span begin="1:27.104" end="1:27.534">た</span><span begin="1:27.534" end="1:27.905">り</span><span begin="1:27.905" end="1:30.704" amll:empty-beat="1">前</span><span begin="1:30.704" end="1:30.893">だ</span><span begin="1:30.893" end="1:31.450">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">搞不懂这些才是人之常情吧 / Things like &quot;the meaning of life&quot; or &quot;the reason to live&quot;</span></p><p begin="1:33.350" end="1:39.359" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.350" end="1:34.253" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="1:34.253" end="1:34.667">に</span><span begin="1:34.667" end="1:35.372" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="1:35.372" end="1:35.817">じ</span><span begin="1:35.817" end="1:36.281">て</span><span begin="1:36.594" end="1:37.002">今</span><span begin="1:37.002" end="1:37.405">日</span><span begin="1:37.405" end="1:37.799">は</span><span begin="1:37.799" end="1:37.969">生</span><span begin="1:37.969" end="1:38.602">き</span><span begin="1:38.602" end="1:38.978">よ</span><span begin="1:38.978" end="1:39.359">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便活下去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s live out today</span></p><p begin="1:39.680" end="1:45.690" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.680" end="1:40.546" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="1:40.546" end="1:40.928">に</span><span begin="1:40.928" end="1:41.693" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="1:41.693" end="1:42.118">じ</span><span begin="1:42.118" end="1:42.468">て</span><span begin="1:42.915" end="1:43.326">今</span><span begin="1:43.326" end="1:43.719">日</span><span begin="1:43.719" end="1:44.119">は</span><span begin="1:44.119" end="1:44.902" amll:empty-beat="1">帰</span><span begin="1:44.902" end="1:45.280">ろ</span><span begin="1:45.280" end="1:45.690">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便回去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s go back home today</span></p><p begin="1:46.039" end="1:52.010" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.039" end="1:46.462">ひ</span><span begin="1:46.462" end="1:46.862">び</span><span begin="1:46.862" end="1:47.258">割</span><span begin="1:47.258" end="1:47.478">れ</span><span begin="1:47.478" end="1:48.018">た</span><span begin="1:48.018" end="1:49.588" amll:empty-beat="2">心</span> <span begin="1:49.588" end="1:50.414" amll:empty-beat="1">繋</span><span begin="1:50.414" end="1:50.625">ぎ</span><span begin="1:50.625" end="1:51.199">止</span><span begin="1:51.199" end="1:51.588">め</span><span begin="1:51.588" end="1:52.010">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">勉强维系着一颗支离破碎的心 / I&apos;m binding back my cracked heart together</span></p><p begin="1:52.307" end="1:59.298" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.307" end="1:53.181" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="1:53.181" end="1:53.589">に</span><span begin="1:53.589" end="1:54.348" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="1:54.348" end="1:54.739">じ</span><span begin="1:54.739" end="1:55.168">て</span><span begin="1:55.550" end="1:56.357" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="1:56.357" end="1:56.717">を</span><span begin="1:56.717" end="1:57.389" amll:empty-beat="1">許</span><span begin="1:57.389" end="1:57.933">そ</span><span begin="1:57.933" end="1:59.298">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p><p begin="2:00.205" end="2:04.850" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.205" end="2:00.664" amll:empty-beat="1">信</span><span begin="2:00.664" end="2:00.895">じ</span><span begin="2:00.895" end="2:01.270">る</span><span begin="2:01.270" end="2:01.484">か</span><span begin="2:01.484" end="2:01.890">ら</span><span begin="2:02.218" end="2:03.075" amll:empty-beat="1">裏</span><span begin="2:03.075" end="2:03.283">切</span><span begin="2:03.283" end="2:03.700">ら</span><span begin="2:03.700" end="2:03.880">れ</span><span begin="2:03.880" end="2:04.850">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为付出信任才会惨遭背叛 / Because I believe, I get betrayed</span></p><p begin="2:06.400" end="2:10.738" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.400" end="2:06.592">期</span><span begin="2:06.592" end="2:06.966" amll:empty-beat="1">待</span><span begin="2:06.966" end="2:07.211">す</span><span begin="2:07.211" end="2:07.679">る</span><span begin="2:08.591" end="2:08.983">か</span><span begin="2:08.983" end="2:09.351">ら</span><span begin="2:09.351" end="2:09.933" amll:empty-beat="1">傷</span><span begin="2:09.933" end="2:10.132">つ</span><span begin="2:10.132" end="2:10.738">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为心有期待才会受伤 / Because I hope, I get hurt</span></p><p begin="2:12.931" end="2:17.119" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.931" end="2:13.086">わ</span><span begin="2:13.086" end="2:13.338">か</span><span begin="2:13.338" end="2:13.526">っ</span><span begin="2:13.526" end="2:13.924">て</span><span begin="2:13.924" end="2:14.129">て</span><span begin="2:14.129" end="2:14.509">も</span> <span begin="2:14.901" end="2:15.287">や</span><span begin="2:15.287" end="2:15.673">め</span><span begin="2:15.673" end="2:15.881">ら</span><span begin="2:15.881" end="2:16.305">れ</span><span begin="2:16.305" end="2:16.499">な</span><span begin="2:16.499" end="2:17.119">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哪怕心里都明白却还是无法作罢 / Even if I get it, I can&apos;t stop</span></p><p begin="2:19.242" end="2:23.919" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.242" end="2:19.424">ど</span><span begin="2:19.424" end="2:19.653">っ</span><span begin="2:19.653" end="2:19.861">か</span><span begin="2:19.861" end="2:20.436">で</span><span begin="2:20.825" end="2:21.519" amll:empty-beat="1">愛</span><span begin="2:21.519" end="2:22.009">し</span><span begin="2:22.009" end="2:22.209">て</span><span begin="2:22.209" end="2:22.597">る</span><span begin="2:22.597" end="2:22.855">か</span><span begin="2:22.855" end="2:23.919">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只因爱意仍在隐隐地涌动 / Because somewhere deep down, I still love them all</span></p><p begin="2:24.411" end="2:30.279" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.411" end="2:25.182" amll:empty-beat="1">痛</span><span begin="2:25.182" end="2:25.361">み</span><span begin="2:25.361" end="2:25.854">を</span><span begin="2:25.854" end="2:26.347">知</span><span begin="2:26.347" end="2:27.119">る</span><span begin="2:27.458" end="2:28.344" amll:empty-beat="1">者</span><span begin="2:28.344" end="2:28.522">で</span><span begin="2:28.522" end="2:29.141">な</span><span begin="2:29.141" end="2:29.499">い</span><span begin="2:29.499" end="2:30.279">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">从来不曾经历过痛苦的人 / Only someone who knows that pain</span></p><p begin="2:30.511" end="2:37.978" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.511" end="2:30.671">泣</span><span begin="2:30.671" end="2:30.889">き</span><span begin="2:30.889" end="2:31.491" amll:empty-beat="1">声</span><span begin="2:31.491" end="2:31.756">の</span><span begin="2:31.756" end="2:32.359" amll:empty-beat="1">周</span><span begin="2:32.359" end="2:32.934">波</span><span begin="2:32.934" end="2:33.831" amll:empty-beat="1">数</span><span begin="2:33.831" end="2:34.020">は</span><span begin="2:34.020" end="2:36.609" amll:empty-beat="1">拾</span><span begin="2:36.609" end="2:36.995">え</span><span begin="2:36.995" end="2:37.162">な</span><span begin="2:37.162" end="2:37.978">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">根本就难以捕捉到哭声的频率 / Can pick up the frequencies of crying voices</span></p><p begin="2:39.609" end="2:45.655" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.609" end="2:40.530" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="2:40.530" end="2:40.962">に</span><span begin="2:40.962" end="2:41.698" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="2:41.698" end="2:42.138">じ</span><span begin="2:42.138" end="2:42.588">て</span><span begin="2:42.925" end="2:43.342">今</span><span begin="2:43.342" end="2:43.717">日</span><span begin="2:43.717" end="2:44.132">は</span><span begin="2:44.132" end="2:44.311">生</span><span begin="2:44.311" end="2:44.932">き</span><span begin="2:44.932" end="2:45.280">よ</span><span begin="2:45.280" end="2:45.655">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便活下去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s live out today</span></p><p begin="2:45.964" end="2:51.975" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.964" end="2:46.864" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="2:46.864" end="2:47.274">に</span><span begin="2:47.274" end="2:48.019" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="2:48.019" end="2:48.443">じ</span><span begin="2:48.443" end="2:48.786">て</span><span begin="2:49.242" end="2:49.631">今</span><span begin="2:49.631" end="2:50.017">日</span><span begin="2:50.017" end="2:50.254">は</span><span begin="2:50.254" end="2:50.619">しゃ</span><span begin="2:50.619" end="2:51.188">が</span><span begin="2:51.188" end="2:51.607">も</span><span begin="2:51.607" end="2:51.975">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便蹲下休息吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s curl up into a ball for today</span></p><p begin="2:52.316" end="2:58.244" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.316" end="2:53.171" amll:empty-beat="1">震</span><span begin="2:53.171" end="2:53.592">え</span><span begin="2:53.592" end="2:53.812">て</span><span begin="2:53.812" end="2:54.385">る</span><span begin="2:54.385" end="2:55.960" amll:empty-beat="2">心</span> <span begin="2:56.247" end="2:56.756">そ</span><span begin="2:56.756" end="2:57.000">ば</span><span begin="2:57.000" end="2:57.530">に</span><span begin="2:57.530" end="2:57.890">い</span><span begin="2:57.890" end="2:58.244">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">请给予这颗颤抖的心陪伴吧 / My shivering heart, I&apos;m by your side</span></p><p begin="2:58.626" end="3:05.655" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.626" end="2:59.509" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="2:59.509" end="2:59.909">に</span><span begin="2:59.909" end="3:00.645" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="3:00.645" end="3:01.074">じ</span><span begin="3:01.074" end="3:01.504">て</span><span begin="3:01.864" end="3:02.634" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="3:02.634" end="3:03.073">を</span><span begin="3:03.073" end="3:03.738" amll:empty-beat="1">許</span><span begin="3:03.738" end="3:04.222">そ</span><span begin="3:04.222" end="3:05.655">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p><p begin="3:18.008" end="3:23.975" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.008" end="3:19.115" amll:empty-beat="2">光</span><span begin="3:19.115" end="3:19.631">降</span><span begin="3:19.631" end="3:19.892">り</span><span begin="3:19.892" end="3:20.156">そ</span><span begin="3:20.156" end="3:20.618">そ</span><span begin="3:20.618" end="3:21.008">ぐ</span><span begin="3:21.175" end="3:21.524" amll:empty-beat="1">人</span><span begin="3:21.524" end="3:21.974" amll:empty-beat="1">生</span><span begin="3:21.974" end="3:22.402">じゃ</span><span begin="3:22.402" end="3:22.644">な</span><span begin="3:22.644" end="3:23.018">い</span><span begin="3:23.018" end="3:23.975">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我的人生从来都没有光芒的眷顾 / It&apos;s not a life where the light shines upon me</span></p><p begin="3:24.324" end="3:30.375" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.324" end="3:25.551" amll:empty-beat="2">涙</span><span begin="3:25.551" end="3:25.969">に</span><span begin="3:25.969" end="3:26.365">ま</span><span begin="3:26.365" end="3:26.558">み</span><span begin="3:26.558" end="3:26.935">れ</span><span begin="3:26.935" end="3:27.335">た</span><span begin="3:27.526" end="3:27.924">過</span><span begin="3:27.924" end="3:28.309">去</span><span begin="3:28.309" end="3:28.717">も</span><span begin="3:28.717" end="3:28.932">あ</span><span begin="3:28.932" end="3:29.329">る</span><span begin="3:29.329" end="3:30.375">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">曾经也有过被泪水浸透的过往 / I have a past covered in tears too</span></p><p begin="3:30.496" end="3:36.586" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.496" end="3:30.670">生</span><span begin="3:30.670" end="3:30.903">き</span><span begin="3:30.903" end="3:31.082">る</span><span begin="3:31.082" end="3:31.506">意</span><span begin="3:31.506" end="3:31.685">味</span><span begin="3:31.685" end="3:32.276">な</span><span begin="3:32.276" end="3:32.661">ん</span><span begin="3:32.661" end="3:33.415">て</span> <span begin="3:33.801" end="3:34.222">理</span><span begin="3:34.222" end="3:34.869" amll:empty-beat="1">由</span><span begin="3:34.869" end="3:35.435">な</span><span begin="3:35.435" end="3:35.840">ん</span><span begin="3:35.840" end="3:36.586">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所谓活着的意义 还有理由之类的 / It&apos;s completely natural to not understand</span></p><p begin="3:36.967" end="3:44.076" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.967" end="3:37.381">わ</span><span begin="3:37.381" end="3:37.809">か</span><span begin="3:37.809" end="3:38.225">ら</span><span begin="3:38.225" end="3:38.576">な</span><span begin="3:38.576" end="3:38.815">く</span><span begin="3:38.815" end="3:39.388">て</span><span begin="3:39.388" end="3:39.781">当</span><span begin="3:39.781" end="3:40.163">た</span><span begin="3:40.163" end="3:40.561">り</span><span begin="3:40.561" end="3:43.335" amll:empty-beat="1">前</span><span begin="3:43.335" end="3:43.535">だ</span><span begin="3:43.535" end="3:44.076">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">搞不懂这些才是人之常情吧 / Things like &quot;the meaning of life&quot; or &quot;the reason to live&quot;</span></p><p begin="3:49.043" end="3:55.116" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.043" end="3:49.992" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="3:49.992" end="3:50.441">に</span><span begin="3:50.441" end="3:51.172" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="3:51.172" end="3:51.588">じ</span><span begin="3:51.588" end="3:52.052">て</span><span begin="3:52.385" end="3:52.799">今</span><span begin="3:52.799" end="3:53.167">日</span><span begin="3:53.167" end="3:53.598">は</span><span begin="3:53.598" end="3:53.784">生</span><span begin="3:53.784" end="3:54.388">き</span><span begin="3:54.388" end="3:54.754">よ</span><span begin="3:54.754" end="3:55.116">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便活下去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s live out today</span></p><p begin="3:55.473" end="4:01.444" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.473" end="3:56.346" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="3:56.346" end="3:56.721">に</span><span begin="3:56.721" end="3:57.488" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="3:57.488" end="3:57.910">じ</span><span begin="3:57.910" end="3:58.284">て</span><span begin="3:58.698" end="3:59.077">今</span><span begin="3:59.077" end="3:59.493">日</span><span begin="3:59.493" end="3:59.885">は</span><span begin="3:59.885" end="4:00.628" amll:empty-beat="1">帰</span><span begin="4:00.628" end="4:01.054">ろ</span><span begin="4:01.054" end="4:01.444">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便回去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s go back home today</span></p><p begin="4:01.827" end="4:07.735" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.827" end="4:02.271">ひ</span><span begin="4:02.271" end="4:02.665">び</span><span begin="4:02.665" end="4:03.078">割</span><span begin="4:03.078" end="4:03.286">れ</span><span begin="4:03.286" end="4:03.850">た</span><span begin="4:03.850" end="4:05.364" amll:empty-beat="2">心</span> <span begin="4:05.364" end="4:06.208" amll:empty-beat="1">繋</span><span begin="4:06.208" end="4:06.390">ぎ</span><span begin="4:06.390" end="4:07.011">止</span><span begin="4:07.011" end="4:07.371">め</span><span begin="4:07.371" end="4:07.735">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">勉强维系着一颗支离破碎的心 / I&apos;m binding back my cracked heart together</span></p><p begin="4:08.108" end="4:15.204" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:08.108" end="4:08.967" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="4:08.967" end="4:09.393">に</span><span begin="4:09.393" end="4:10.107" amll:empty-beat="1">免</span><span begin="4:10.107" end="4:10.536">じ</span><span begin="4:10.536" end="4:10.906">て</span><span begin="4:11.355" end="4:12.124" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="4:12.124" end="4:12.531">を</span><span begin="4:12.531" end="4:13.176" amll:empty-beat="1">許</span><span begin="4:13.176" end="4:13.639">そ</span><span begin="4:13.639" end="4:15.204">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p></div></body></tt>